### Beneficiaries Endpoints
### Base URL: http://localhost:8000

### Create Beneficiary
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/beneficiaries
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: {{sessionCookie}}

{
  "type": "individual",
  "name": "John Doe",
  "email": "john@example.com",
  "phone": "+1234567890",
  "country": "US"
}

### List All Beneficiaries
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/beneficiaries
Cookie: {{sessionCookie}}

### Example Response:
# [
#   {
#     "id": "beneficiary-uuid",
#     "type": "individual",
#     "name": "John Doe",
#     "email": "john@example.com",
#     "phone": "+1234567890",
#     "country": "US",
#     "created_at": "2025-01-11T10:00:00Z"
#   }
# ]
